This is the mode_s_decode-write-a-block package meant as a guide to building
out-of-tree packages. To use the mode_s_decode blocks, the Python namespaces
is in 'mode_s_decode', which is imported as:

    import mode_s_decode

See the Doxygen documentation for details about the blocks available
in this package. A quick listing of the details can be found in Python
after importing by using:

    help(mode_s_decode)
